{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"screen\":\"知道一旦说出口关系可能改变，才格外谨慎\",\"source\":\"又明白有些话一旦说出口，关系就会改变，所以格外谨慎\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿认为说出口就会改变关系，屏幕稿改成关系可能改变，削弱了原本的确定性。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"前面悬置已久的期待，终于得到了某种回应\",\"source\":\"前面悬置已久的期待，终于得到了某种满足\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"把期待得到满足改成得到回应，增加了期待收到某种答复的意味。\"},{\"sec\":\"S12\",\"screen\":\"喉咙发紧、眼眶湿润，快乐到连自己想笑还是想哭都分不清\",\"source\":\"又可以是喉咙发紧、眼眶湿润，快乐到连自己想笑还是想哭都分不清\",\"type\":\"7\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将喉咙发紧、眼眶湿润作为另一种并列的感受，屏幕稿接在久别重逢的拥抱之后，容易变成同一场景的后续反应。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "29cb942f-c5b2-4bee-9a2d-a0ab2ed1a3a2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T082341329984Z", "elapsed_seconds": 225.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T08:27:26.961940+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "940c9b16fbeedb8b0bf1d9e7842be785407ae871899c454a32c5f274bd67f4b7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48"